      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Last year, this company did not pay a cent of federal tax in the USA, and
    it is hard to get information if it does in other places in the world. The company
    has mastered the art of avoidance, exploiting foreign tax havens, and moonwalking
    through the seemingly infinite loopholes that accountants apparently willingly
    work out for them. Alongside their spending on lobbying (which have increased
    by almost 420% since 2012) and the fact that they sell facial recognition software
    to law enforcement and ICE tells a story about lies and exploitation. Without
    even mentioning the environmental implications of promising two day shipping
    and the increasing use of plastic and paper packaging, a company who hides behind
    a successful front while operating in the shadows isn't a safe and sustainable
    investment.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4c607bc552d27574281ceda981cb73ea, type: 2}
