      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The reason for it being the only company left in the top 10 is due to the
    fact that climate sustainable companies have pushed the others out of the way.
    This company has poor prospects, with decreasing revenues from $466 billion in
    2008 to about half in 2017. Moreover, legal risks in the fossil fuel industry
    are growing. Groups of investors, institutions, customers, cities, and American
    states are suing fossil companies over their environmental impact, and their
    neglect to report the risks associated with fossil fuels for decades. Investing
    your money in this company does not only contribute to more c02 compared to XXX,
    but you also risk losing the money.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
